  "construction": "One-block cyclic stabilizer code: generator X^a Z^b and its 31 cyclic shifts, a(x) = x^15 + x^16, b(x) = x^9 + x^13 + x^18 + x^22 in F_2[x]/(x^31 - 1); a = g p, b = g q with p, q palindromic so that a b* + b a* = 0; k = deg gcd(a, b, x^31 - 1)",
